                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Seems a fun game. For me it is limited because I refuse to let Adobe save the game, so if I want to play I need to play the whole game in one chunk.\r\nThe gameplay is fine, you have a territory, eventually more than one, and you spend money to do various things, increase gold production, allow yourself to build more commoners or noble units, then you have to construct the buildings that let you built the assorted unit types.\r\nA pretty decent tutorial talks you thru all this.\r\nOddly enough, given the name of the game, the tutorial does not cover magic! I think I figured it out pretty quickly though. Click on the book, click on the page, click on the rainbow colored icon in the middle, close the book cast the spell.\r\nSadly every battle map seems to same, and there is a problem with balance as ranged units dominate, but that's not a big deal.\r\nOne thumb up.",
